@startuml trust_boundary
title Trust boundary — page text cannot steer control flow
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "TRUSTED (sets control flow)" as T {
  [Human goal / demonstration] as G0
  [Compiled Procedure] as P0
  [Allowlist · risk classes · budgets] as AL
}
rectangle "UNTRUSTED (data only)" as UT {
  [Page content\nincl. injected instructions] as PG
  [Model output] as MO
}
rectangle "DETERMINISTIC CODE" as C {
  [Safety gate] as GATE
  [Executor] as EXEC
  [Verifier] as VER
}
G0 --> GATE
P0 --> EXEC
AL --> GATE
PG --> MO : observed
MO --> GATE : proposal only
GATE --> EXEC
EXEC --> VER
PG ..> AL : cannot modify
MO ..> AL : cannot modify
note bottom of C
  Control flow is fixed from trusted inputs before untrusted
  data is read (CaMeL pattern). A learned Procedure has no
  path from page text to its plan.
end note
@enduml
